# Fungal Fortitude enchants any creature, an opponent's too: Bot1 flashes it onto Bot2's Memnite on turn 2 (3/1). When that Memnite attacks on turn 4 and Bot1's Memnite blocks, both die, and the enchanted one
# "return[s] to the battlefield tapped under its owner's control" (CR 110.2a): under Bot2, its owner, never under Bot1 who controls the Aura. It comes back tapped as a plain 1/1 (CR 400.7).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Fungal Fortitude
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Fungal Fortitude.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 3
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Block(Memnite > Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Life = 20
